Id: ali004w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_aliases

The indicated alias is a program alias, but the executable has group
write permission, world write permission or both.  This allows others
to replace/modify the executable, possibly allowing them to gain
unauthorized privileges.

It is a WARN because its group can write it and the file named is
executable.

Until 3.4.0 this was reported as ali004, without the letter for its level.
